# # Example Crontab — Weekly Digest
#
#   Sample crontab entry for Pepper's calendar-aware Monday digest on a Raspberry Pi.
#
# INPUT:
#   - None (reference file; copy or use `install-weekly-cron.sh` instead).
#
# OUTPUT:
#   - Hourly cron line template for `run-weekly-digest.sh`.
#
# NOTES:
#   - Prefer `./scripts/install-weekly-cron.sh` for idempotent install.
#   - Debug: `cd ~/pepper-crm && ./pepper --schedule-status`
#
# Written by Cursor for Ready Mouse and Pepper CRM. May 2026. All rights reserved.

SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin

0 * * * * PEPPER_HOME=/home/pi/pepper-crm /home/pi/pepper-crm/scripts/run-weekly-digest.sh
